<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Beranda - Rencanaku.ai</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/app.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-900 text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col">
    <header class="bg-gray-800 border-b border-gray-700 p-4">
        <div class="container mx-auto flex items-center justify-between">
            <h1 class="text-xl font-bold">Rencanaku.ai</h1>
            <nav>
                <ul class="flex space-x-4">
                    <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-purple-400">Dashboard</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/projects" class="hover:text-purple-400">Proyek</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/settings" class="hover:text-purple-400">Pengaturan</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="flex-1 container mx-auto p-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-12">
            <div class="text-center max-w-2xl">
                <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Selamat Datang di Rencanaku.ai</h1>
                <p class="text-gray-300 mb-8">
                    Aplikasi pendamping perencanaan proyek berbasis AI. 
                    Bantu Anda mengembangkan ide menjadi rencana yang terstruktur dan dokumen konteks proyek.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
                    <a href="/projects" class="bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition">
                        Mulai Proyek Baru
                    </a>
                    <a href="/conversations" class="bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition">
                        Lihat Percakapan
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="bg-gray-800 border-t border-gray-700 p-4 text-center text-sm text-gray-400">
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Rencanaku.ai - Aplikasi Pendamping Perencanaan Proyek
    </footer>

    <!-- JavaScript -->
    <script src="/assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>